<h3>1:00:54 — Last option trap: overloading **seems** valid, but `static`+`abstract` is CE</h3>
<p>Take all. The last one is invalid because most people, by overloading, think it is valid. It is not. Static and abstract we cannot apply simultaneously for methods. If we try, compiler error.</p>
