<tr><th>Property</th><th>Overloading</th><th>Overriding</th></tr>
<tr><td>Method names</td><td>must be same</td><td>must be same</td></tr>
<tr><td>Argument types</td><td>must be different (at least order)</td><td>must be same including order</td></tr>
